OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for stealing and
OL,4,Akilling pet ferrets
OL,5,
OL,6,FWARNING: This story contains details
OL,7,Fthat some readers may find upsetting.
OL,9,FA man who stole pet ferrets from his
OL,10,Fneighbour which were killed by dogs has
OL,11,Fbeen jailed.
OL,13,FAxel Read, 24, broke into the animal
OL,14,Fenclosures at the home of Laice
OL,15,FCleough, in the Upperby area of
OL,16,FCarlisle, and stole her two ferrets on
OL,17,F1 August 2024. Cleough later found her
OL,18,Fpets dead, one in a nearby bin and the
OL,19,Fother close by.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
